{
  "note": "Golden answers of the delegation-of-authority matrix (ST-ADM-011, BR-ADM-03, BR-ADM-04). Shared by the kernel (resolveDoa, the findings of a draft and of a submission) and the web (the band chart and the 'who approves' preview): both must give these answers. Amounts are whole VND written as strings; thresholds are placeholders, the real ones are tenant data (CXN-DOA-01).",
